    			<p class="e-2hjlwo-e0002d-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0002d">// 01 · incident</p>
					<h2 data-interaction-id="e0002e" class="e-2hjlwo-e0002e-s e-heading-base">The failure that costs you a weekend.</h2>
					<p class="e-2hjlwo-e0002f-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0002f">The agent answered wrong at 02:41. Your logs have the prompt and the final string, and nothing in between — no tool arguments, no intermediate messages, no token accounting. So you guess, you patch, you deploy, and you wait to see if it happens again.</p>
		<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0002g e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-2hjlwo-e0002g-s " data-id="e0002g" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0002g">
    			<p class="e-2hjlwo-e0002h-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0002h">$400 / night · 11 nights</p>
					<p class="e-2hjlwo-e0002i-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0002i">A tool-call loop nobody could see, billed at full rate until someone read the invoice.</p>
		
</div>

</div>
